AaveV4Adapter_deposit
  ├── when the caller is not the vault
  │   └── it should revert
  └── when the caller is the vault
      ├── when the actual deposited amount is less than the amount supplied
      │   └── it should revert
      ├── when TVL decreases during the deposit
      │   └── it should revert
      ├── when the credited shortfall exceeds the rounding tolerance
      │   └── it should revert
      ├── when the credited shortfall equals the rounding tolerance
      │   └── it should succeed
      ├── when the credited amount exceeds the requested amount
      │   └── it should succeed
      └── when the actual deposited amount equals the amount supplied
          ├── it should emit a Deposit event
          └── it should supply USDC to the Aave V4 spoke
